{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-7-1","title":"Psalms 7:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David prays against the malice of his enemies, professing his innocency. 10 By faith he sees his defence, and the destruction of his enemies.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2983. B.C. 1021. (Title.) Shiggaion.{Shiggaion} probably denotes a mournful song or, elegy, from the Arabic {shaga,} to be anxious, sorrowful.</p>\n<p>Hab 3:1 words. or, business. 2Sa 16:1-23 Cush.{Cush} signifies black, an epithet, in all languages, when applied to the mind, expressive of moral turpitude; and therefore probably here applied to {Shimei,} denoting that he was a calumniator and villain.</p>\n<p>O. 13:3,5; 18:28; 30:2,12; 43:4; 89:26; Jos 14:8; Jer 31:18 Da 9:4,19,20; Zec 14:5 in. 11:1; 18:2; 25:2; 26:1; 31:1; 32:10; 146:3-6; Isa 50:10; 1Pe 1:21 save. 3:7; 17:7-9; 31:15; 35:1-3; Jer 15:15; 20:11; 1Pe 4:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-2","title":"Psalms 7:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Lest. 35:15; Isa 38:13 like. 10:9; 17:12; 22:13; De 33:20; Pr 19:12; 2Ti 4:17; 1Pe 5:8 rending. 50:22; Ho 13:7,8 while. Jud 18:28; 2Sa 14:6; *marg: Job 10:7 not to deliver. Heb. not a deliverer.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-3","title":"Psalms 7:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>if I. 59:3; Jos 22:22; 1Sa 20:8; 22:8,13; 24:9; 26:18,19; 2Sa 16:7,8 Job 16:17-19 if there. 66:18; 1Sa 24:11; Job 11:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-4","title":"Psalms 7:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>If I. 55:20; 109:5; Ge 44:4; Pr 17:3; Jer 18:20,21 I have. 1Sa 24:7,10,11; 26:9-17,24 without. 1Sa 19:4,5; 20:1; 22:14; 24:11-15,17-19; 25:28,29; 26:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-5","title":"Psalms 7:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Let. Job 31:5-10,38-40 tread. 44:5; 60:12; Job 40:12; Isa 10:6; 63:3; Zec 10:5; Mal 4:3 lay. 49:12; Job 16:15; 40:13; Jer 17:13 Selah. 3:2; Hab 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-6","title":"Psalms 7:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Arise. 3:7; 12:5; 35:1,23; 44:26; 68:1,2; Isa 3:13 lift up. 74:3; 94:1,2; Isa 33:10; 37:20 awake. 44:23; 59:5; 73:20; 78:65; Isa 51:9 to the. 76:8,9; 103:6; 2Sa 17:14; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-7","title":"Psalms 7:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>So. 48:11; 58:10,11; Re 11:17,18; 16:5-7; 18:20; 19:2 return. 93:4; 113:5,6; 138:6; Isa 57:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-8","title":"Psalms 7:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>The Lord. 9:8; 11:4; 82:1; 96:13; 98:9; Ge 18:25; Ac 17:31; Ro 14:10-12 1Co 4:4,5 judge. 26:1; 35:24; 43:1; Ge 31:53; 2Ch 20:12 according. 17:2,3; 18:20-24; 35:24-27; 2Co 1:12 to mine. 25:21; 26:11; 41:12; 78:72; Pr 19:1; 1Th 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-9","title":"Psalms 7:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Oh. 9:5,6; 10:15,18; 58:6; 74:10,11,22,23; Isa 37:36-38; Da 11:45 Ac 12:23 but. 37:23; *marg: 40:2; 1Sa 2:9; Ro 16:25; 1Th 3:13; 1Pe 5:10; Jude 1:1 for. 17:3; 44:21; 139:1; 1Sa 16:7; 1Ch 28:9; Jer 11:20; 17:10; 20:12 Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-10","title":"Psalms 7:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>My, etc. Heb. My buckler is upon God. 3:3; 18:1,2; 84:11; 89:18; Ge 15:1 which. 112:2; 125:4; Job 8:6; Pr 2:21; 11:20; 28:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-11","title":"Psalms 7:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>or, God is a righteous Judge. 8; 94:15; 140:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-12","title":"Psalms 7:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>If. 85:4; Isa 55:6,7; Jer 31:18,19; Eze 18:30; 33:11; Mt 3:10; Ac 3:19 he will. De 32:41; Isa 27:1; 34:5; Eze 21:9-11,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-13","title":"Psalms 7:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>ordaineth. 11:2; 45:5; 64:3,7; 144:6; De 32:23,42; Job 6:4; La 3:12,13 Hab 3:11,13 persecutors. 2Th 1:6; Re 6:10; 16:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-14","title":"Psalms 7:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Job 15:20,35; Isa 33:11; 59:4,5; Jas 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-15","title":"Psalms 7:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>made. Heb. hath digged. 35:7; 119:85; Job 6:27; Jer 18:20 and is. 9:15,16; 10:2; 35:8; 94:13; 140:9,10; 141:10; Es 7:10; Job 4:8 Pr 5:22; 26:27; Ec 10:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-16","title":"Psalms 7:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>36:4,12; 37:12,13; 1Sa 23:9; 24:12,13; 26:10; 28:19; 31:3,4 1Ki 2:32; Es 9:25; Mal 2:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-7-17","title":"Psalms 7:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>according. 35:28; 51:14; 71:15,16; 98:2; 111:3; 145:7 most. 9:2; 92:1,8; Da 4:17,25,34; Ac 7:48</p>"}]}